    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/776be832ffc554a73dbc716334a8f125.avif?t=1737757694\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hellopoly </strong> is a challenging, narrative-driven adventure platformer: climb high-height locations with the use of your directional charge jump while discovering an exciting original narrative along the way! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What it's about: </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've been hired (kidnapped) by the Devil of Hell, <i>Mr. Business</i>, to resolve a critical production issue that could make or break the business. Enter into the fast-paced work environment of Hell, meet your new demon co-workers (they hate you), and uncover their dark secrets before your soul is lost forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What it's got: </strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various challenging locations to climb, each with unique characters, obstacles, and scenery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multitude of dynamic movement options, including directional charge jumping, running, sliding, air floating, fast falling, wall bouncing, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming, character-driven story full of heart and laughs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant world with tons of interesting characters to chat with, exciting places to explore, and <i>secrets waiting to be found</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boldly ugly main character </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you escape this HELLISH startup alive? No, but <i>hey</i>, that's just BUSINESS!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/f3ff79644a377784dbd5e22a83a7fc72.poster.avif?t=1737757694\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/f3ff79644a377784dbd5e22a83a7fc72.apng?t=1737757694\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/776be832ffc554a73dbc716334a8f125.avif?t=1737757694\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hellopoly </strong> is a challenging, narrative-driven adventure platformer: climb high-height locations with the use of your directional charge jump while discovering an exciting original narrative along the way! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What it's about: </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've been hired (kidnapped) by the Devil of Hell, <i>Mr. Business</i>, to resolve a critical production issue that could make or break the business. Enter into the fast-paced work environment of Hell, meet your new demon co-workers (they hate you), and uncover their dark secrets before your soul is lost forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What it's got: </strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various challenging locations to climb, each with unique characters, obstacles, and scenery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A multitude of dynamic movement options, including directional charge jumping, running, sliding, air floating, fast falling, wall bouncing, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming, character-driven story full of heart and laughs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vibrant world with tons of interesting characters to chat with, exciting places to explore, and <i>secrets waiting to be found</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boldly ugly main character </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you escape this HELLISH startup alive? No, but <i>hey</i>, that's just BUSINESS!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/f3ff79644a377784dbd5e22a83a7fc72.poster.avif?t=1737757694\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068840/extras/f3ff79644a377784dbd5e22a83a7fc72.apng?t=1737757694\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p>",
